@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
  * REST endpoints for meta operations:
  * - GET /api/meta/session - get session context
  * - GET /api/meta/agents - list agents
+ * - PATCH /api/meta/agents/:id - update agent definition
  * - GET /api/meta/workflows - list workflows
